{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hexisle</strong></i> is a casual, relaxing, incremental game where your goal is to completely dismantle a massive, procedurally generated island of hexagons and confront the great evil that lurks at its center. You'll start off slowly digging through the sand with your bare hands, and gradually upgrade your way toward a set of divine tools capable of instantaneous mass excavation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/65387d06889388d27b6e9dd6c3eaf42e.poster.avif?t=1765787623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/65387d06889388d27b6e9dd6c3eaf42e.webm?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/65387d06889388d27b6e9dd6c3eaf42e.mp4?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexisle takes the concept of a mindless tile-tapping game and blends it with incremental upgrade systems, exploration, and survival-crafting elements to create a uniquely satisfying and cathartic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/5f555406fea43fdc19564097732362ef.poster.avif?t=1765787623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/5f555406fea43fdc19564097732362ef.webm?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/5f555406fea43fdc19564097732362ef.mp4?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hex, object, and monster you destroy earns you <strong>hEXP</strong> and raw materials, which in turn can be used to <strong>upgrade</strong> your tools and abilities, leading to quicker and more wide-spread excavation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/3e1b1fcdbc37f1f6f5fec3aeb39c9331.poster.avif?t=1765787623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/3e1b1fcdbc37f1f6f5fec3aeb39c9331.webm?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/3e1b1fcdbc37f1f6f5fec3aeb39c9331.mp4?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the raw materials from destroyed hexes on the <strong>Hexology</strong> grid to create your own mini-island that generates <strong>Mana</strong> for further upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/a37329d42117bc65b5ad267e85474b5c.poster.avif?t=1765787623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/a37329d42117bc65b5ad267e85474b5c.webm?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/a37329d42117bc65b5ad267e85474b5c.mp4?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the abundant fruits and fish found throughout the island to brew powerful <strong>smoothies</strong> that impart various useful effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/a1b6c419440567bac2062bdfe478f2c9.poster.avif?t=1765787623\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/a1b6c419440567bac2062bdfe478f2c9.webm?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/a1b6c419440567bac2062bdfe478f2c9.mp4?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchant your tools by socketing<strong> gems</strong>\u00a0plundered from monsters and chests, and really ramp up the speed and efficiency of your demolition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/005a4f93f72582d58bd444242dde2c81.poster.avif?t=1765787623\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/005a4f93f72582d58bd444242dde2c81.webm?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/005a4f93f72582d58bd444242dde2c81.mp4?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy every last hex to lift the curse and finally leave the island for good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/bde3198076662ea0751aa1e9ecc85420.poster.avif?t=1765787623\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/bde3198076662ea0751aa1e9ecc85420.webm?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/bde3198076662ea0751aa1e9ecc85420.mp4?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, further test your skills in the never-ending roguelite-esque <strong>Endless</strong> mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/9b88a94942f9bbe8a147823c9ae42a70.poster.avif?t=1765787623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/9b88a94942f9bbe8a147823c9ae42a70.webm?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/9b88a94942f9bbe8a147823c9ae42a70.mp4?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4140340?t=1765787623","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4140340?t=1765787623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/49f481574e738112081861003b9688b0dbb31adc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765787623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/49f481574e738112081861003b9688b0dbb31adc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765787623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4187