/span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hex, object, and monster you destroy earns you <strong>hEXP</strong> and raw materials, which in turn can be used to <strong>upgrade</strong> your tools and abilities, leading to quicker and more wide-spread excavation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/3e1b1fcdbc37f1f6f5fec3aeb39c9331.poster.avif?t=1765787623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/3e1b1fcdbc37f1f6f5fec3aeb39c9331.webm?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/3e1b1fcdbc37f1f6f5fec3aeb39c9331.mp4?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the raw materials from destroyed hexes on the <strong>Hexology</strong> grid to create your own mini-island that generates <strong>Mana</strong> for further upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/a37329d42117bc65b5ad267e85474b5c.poster.avif?t=1765787623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/a37329d42117bc65b5ad267e85474b5c.webm?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140340/extras/a37329d42117bc65b5ad267e85474b5c.mp4?t=1765787623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the abundant fruits and fish found throughout the island to brew powerful <strong>smoothies</strong> that impart various useful effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video